WEBVTT

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:09.730
Reigyoku.

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:15.120
I dragged a lot of people into 
this for Chou Soran's sake.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:17.980
Are you not going to reprimand me?

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:22.670
I would never reprimand you, Master.

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:28.880
You certainly are perfect and without 
flaws, but you're a tad too serious.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:33.790
Why don't I give you a bit of advice?

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.640
Listen closely.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.360
Go beat the stuffing out of Chou Soran.

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:16.740
<b>15: Dauntless</b>

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:32.670
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:31.040
Who do you think will win, 
Reigyoku-sama or Chou Soran?

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.610
It goes without saying.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:37.590
Anyway, I'm amazed that shameless 
cheater made it to the finals.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:40.700
I wonder what kind of underhanded 
trick he'll use this time.

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:43.860
Maybe he'll actually put up a good fight.

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:47.820
Reigyoku-sama won't fall for stupid tricks.

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:52.760
He's already here?

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.250
<i>This isn't a dream.</i>

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:04.020
<i>I can't believe I really made it to the finals.</i>

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:10.320
<i>My hands are shaking. Am I excited?</i>

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:14.830
<i>Or is it anticipation? No, fear?</i>

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.670
<i>Of course.</i>

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:22.670
<i>I won't be able to defeat my opponent 
unless I use everything I have.</i>

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:29.310
<i>I'll have to use the power I've been hiding 
until now, in front of all these people.</i>

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:34.610
<i>I've definitely gotten stronger 
in the past month.</i>

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:38.000
<i>That's why I got a stronger sense than ever</i>

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:40.570
<i>of Reigyoku-sama's strength.</i>

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:45.230
<i>If Jo San or Jo Yon were in my 
position, what would they think?</i>

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:48.220
<i>What about Hou-nee?</i>

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:55.300
<i>Sheesh. I'm over-thinking this.</i>

00:03:57.110 --> 00:03:59.550
<i>I already found my answer.</i>

00:03:59.940 --> 00:04:02.450
<i>There's no point in worrying 
about it anymore.</i>

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:07.150
<i>Hou-nee probably wouldn't think anything.</i>

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:12.100
<i>She had a lot of strange 
qualities I didn't get at first,</i>

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.470
<i>but I'm starting to understand</i>

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:17.380
<i>the source of her strength.</i>

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.650
<i>She eats when it's time to eat.</i>

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:23.300
<i>She sleeps when it's time to sleep.</i>

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:26.070
<i>She fights when it's time to fight.</i>

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:30.150
<i>Hou-nee can only ever 
do one thing at a time.</i>

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:33.050
<i>She only focuses on one thing at a time.</i>

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:36.920
<i>She's strong because she's pure.</i>

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:43.710
<i>Reigyoku-sama, my Yougorai is strong 
enough to cancel out your Ingorai.</i>

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:48.240
<i>But I'm still fundamentally much weaker.</i>

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:53.350
<i>Overwhelming strength and 
superhuman movements...</i>

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.940
<i>Reigyoku-sama is strong.</i>

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:58.890
<i>So are Shokatsu Sei and Ouya-san.</i>

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:03.960
<i>I can't stop the monsters 
before me from evolving.</i>

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.400
<i>Don't think about your opponent.</i>

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:12.010
<i>The only thing you can control is yourself.</i>

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:16.790
<i>Get as close as you can to Hou-nee's purity.</i>

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:18.630
<i>That's right.</i>

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.570
<i>The person standing before me 
now is a version of myself</i>

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.720
<i>who has exceeded my limits.</i>

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:31.130
<i>I will exceed my limits and become 
the strongest I've ever been!</i>

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.680
<b>Shoushinrai!</b>

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:54.550
Fantastic, Chou Soran.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:58.760
You're like a completely 
different person today.

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:03.560
Now that you're cornered, have you 
decided to show your true strength?

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:10.210
Reigyoku-sama, the technique I'm about 
to use is one I developed on my own.

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:14.300
It's not stable yet, though, 
so I can only use it for five minutes.

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:16.950
Don't worry about it.

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:20.150
It won't take five minutes to defeat you.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.370
Is that right?

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:23.850
Jinrai!

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:04.830
Well, well. You caught up to my speed.

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:10.100
You directed your own Shoushinrai inward 
to stimulate your meridian channels.

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:12.150
It's a good idea.

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:13.800
Caught up?

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.920
No, you're wrong!

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.850
This is my fully-powered Jinrai!

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:34.730
<i>An impressive blow.</i>

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:38.460
<i>The Yougorai inside my body is running wild.</i>

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:39.650
<i>However...</i>

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:51.120
<i>What is this strange feeling?</i>

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:56.270
<i>It's humid and sticky and heavy.</i>

00:07:57.190 --> 00:08:00.430
<i>It's like all my bones and 
flesh are being melted.</i>

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:03.950
<i>Is this Suizourai?</i>

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.470
<i>Is this what Gramps told me about?</i>

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:11.820
Gramps, I learned to 
control shinki and haiki.

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:14.580
That's two kinds of ki.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:22.390
If I learn to use jinki and kanki, too, 
then will I become even stronger?

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:26.780
Good idea, Soran.

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:31.700
But now that you've learned 
to control shinki and haiki,

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:36.830
you can't learn the powers 
of jinki and kanki anymore.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.460
Huh? Why not?

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:42.940
You've become a monkey.

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:44.320
A monkey?

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:46.490
Who's a monkey?

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:49.970
Forget about jinki and kanki.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:54.670
It's impossible for you to learn 
them at your current skill level.

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:58.200
Or rather, you mustn't.

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.030
Huh?

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:03.900
Do you remember which animals 
correspond to the five types of ki?

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:06.180
Yeah, I do.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:09.990
Then what corresponds to shinki and haiki?

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:12.600
The monkey.

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:14.800
That's right.

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:18.920
Our ancestors compared the 
youki-based shinki and haiki

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:22.910
to a monkey born from fire.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:29.910
That's why I called you a monkey now 
that you've learned to control youki.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:36.380
Shinki is about leaping and 
jumping, just like the heart.

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:42.710
And that monkey must strive 
to achieve nothingness.

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:45.300
In other words, like Wukong.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:51.260
You're still a long way away from that.

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:56.300
And youki has a natural enemy.

00:09:56.300 --> 00:10:00.320
It is jinki and kanki's inki.

00:10:00.710 --> 00:10:05.650
Inki's corresponding animal is the boar.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:11.100
This boar presides over the 
various desires of humankind.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.590
Money and power, appetite and lust.

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:19.710
So in order to make this boar submit,

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.100
you must impose restrictions on yourself.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:25.810
Give up your desires and follow the rules.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:28.470
In other words, like Bajie.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:33.400
But you still mustn't assume 
all human desires are evil.

00:10:34.330 --> 00:10:40.280
Knowing the difference between 
good and evil is the boar's goal.

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:46.780
So what is hiki, the remaining type of ki?

00:10:47.150 --> 00:10:55.170
Hiki, which falls under 
earth, is a quiet, calm ki.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:56.350
In other words,

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:59.250
like Sha Wujing.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:01.820
When the negative and 
positive come into conflict,

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:04.840
its role is to mediate between the two.

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.800
Remember this, Soran.

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:13.350
You must never awaken the inki boar.

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:17.120
If your inki runs out of control, 
your youki will be disrupted.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:21.990
All your training until 
now will be for naught.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:25.290
The monkey and boar are opposites.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:29.030
They can never coexist.

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:34.250
<i>That's right. This is what 
Gramps told me about.</i>

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:39.860
<i>Yougorai...</i>

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:43.680
<i>The positive power that's 
the opposite of mine.</i>

00:11:54.170 --> 00:12:00.600
<i>Gramps, I finally understand 
the power of the negative now.</i>

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:31.600
<i>He seems composed even though 
I drove back his Suizourai.</i>

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:33.710
Chou Soran.

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:37.870
What do you think of my Suizourai?

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:42.190
This life force came from inside my body.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:45.770
It's proof of my impurity.

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:51.300
For an ordinary person, their life force 
flowing out of their body may be no big deal.

00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:55.700
But when I was a child, I entered a temple.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:59.720
I trained as a monk.

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:05.000
But I easily abandoned my purity.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:06.080
What?

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:10.010
So the rumors that Reigyoku-sama 
had a lover were true?

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:12.300
But he seems like such a serious monk.

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:14.730
Who was she?

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.890
This is a nightmare!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:22.540
This unsightly Suizourai is my guilt itself.

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:29.230
But instead of facing my 
guilt, I lied to myself.

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:34.090
I even took my anger out on 
you, since you were pure.

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:39.420
When I learned my master was 
trying to make you his student,

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:42.630
I came to truly hate you.

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:50.210
When I learned you were qualified to 
succeed the Tenshi, I envied you!

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:56.600
Chou Soran, I'm sorry.

00:13:57.260 --> 00:14:02.500
I've treated you poorly until 
now because I was immature.

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:13.410
I don't accept your apology.

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:14.330
Huh?

00:14:15.390 --> 00:14:18.030
The grass is always greener, right?

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:21.350
I can't believe you were worried about that.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.780
Let's finish this.

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:28.230
You seem to have expended a lot of energy,

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:32.870
but it seems I overexerted myself 
escaping from your Suizourai.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:38.400
Since you opened up to me, 
I'll tell you something, too.

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:41.560
You should cheat more, Reigyoku-sama.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:49.830
Have you considered becoming more earnest?

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:54.350
<i>No way...</i>

00:15:54.350 --> 00:15:57.100
<i>This is that shameless cheater?</i>

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:00.640
Is this Soran's true power?

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:05.070
Dad, how long have you known 
what he's really like?

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:08.750
Why do you always go to extremes?

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:09.600
Huh?

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:14.670
Why do you assume his behavior 
until now has been all for show?

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:18.640
The Chou Soran you call shameless

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:25.120
is the same Chou Soran fighting Chou 
Reigyoku fair and square right now.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:26.480
But...

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:32.080
I've never thought Soran-kun 
was wearing a mask.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:38.510
He never tried to hide his cowardice, his 
underhandedness, or his shamelessness.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:42.990
Everyone assumed that side of 
him was all there was to him.

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:46.550
That's probably what he wanted.

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:48.640
Look around you.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:53.760
Hardly anyone here thinks 
of him as Chou Soran,

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:58.540
successor to the mysterious 
and secret art of kitaigen.

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:04.460
No one cares if he's actually 
the successor anymore.

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:12.510
He knows what he needs and 
what he should give up.

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:16.580
And he has the capacity to make that happen.

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:21.610
Patience, courage, and strength of will.

00:17:21.610 --> 00:17:23.770
That's what I was drawn to.

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:27.440
It doesn't seem like Soran 
has any of those qualities.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.760
Shinton, when you judge a person,

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:35.120
you should judge them not based on 
their words, but on their actions.

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:40.740
Do you remember the first time 
I bought you a computer?

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:42.160
Huh?

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:44.610
When you were nine, you said that

00:17:44.610 --> 00:17:47.480
you didn't want to borrow your 
sister's computer anymore

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:50.340
and wanted one of your own.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:54.970
At the time, your teeth were full of 
cavities from eating too much candy.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:57.540
That's when I told you

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:02.350
that I'd buy you a computer if you 
didn't eat candy for a week.

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:08.090
In the end, you gave in and 
ate them on the second day.

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:09.090
Huh?

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:12.760
But you bought me a computer.

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:15.440
What does that have to do with Soran?

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:21.580
You had no patience when you were 
nine, but Soran-kun was different.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:26.060
Since Soran-kun appeared in the 
world of outsiders a few months ago,

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:28.700
we've done a lot of research on him.

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:36.540
We didn't find much, but you failed 
to notice the secret behind that.

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:40.880
Since Chou Shakurin died, 
the Express Delivery Company

00:18:40.880 --> 00:18:43.170
had set their eyes on Soran-kun.

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:47.040
Until Zensei noticed Soran-kun's existence,

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:51.010
they assumed he was an ordinary 
person and not an outsider.

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:55.750
But the Express Delivery Company 
didn't judge him hastily.

00:18:56.810 --> 00:19:00.860
Though they kept their distance,

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:04.670
I'm sure they investigated him thoroughly 
and over a long period of time.

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:09.100
If I'm right, then Soran-kun gave up what

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:14.670
Chou Shakurin taught him and
lived as an ordinary person

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:18.490
in order to fool the Express Delivery 
Company for over ten years.

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:23.420
Well? Have you realized 
how terrifying he is yet?

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:30.710
Yes, the man before you facing off 
against Chou Reigyoku right now

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:34.470
has more than a ten-year gap in his history.

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:37.850
Suizou Yuuinrai!

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:39.430
White Komushin!

00:19:41.840 --> 00:19:43.740
Wh-What is this?

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:50.600
<i>The inside of my body is burning hot.</i>

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:55.830
<i>Damn. It feels like my bones 
are being frozen to the core.</i>

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:59.470
<i>This power is the opposite of mine.</i>

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:03.130
Chou Soran, you seem to understand, as well.

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:07.820
Yeah. Our techniques cancel each other out.

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:10.090
They're opposites.

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:13.140
This fight is a simple contest of endurance.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:16.830
But I'm nearly at my limit.

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:20.290
Won't you let me strike 
first, Reigyoku-sama?

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:23.690
Fine by me. You can attack first.

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:25.280
All right.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:27.370
This is my final attack!

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:38.930
White Nagamushi!

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:41.010
Go!

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:43.680
<i>It's fast.</i>

00:20:58.030 --> 00:21:00.920
<i>Yougorai that can be 
controlled from a distance?</i>

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:09.420
<i>I see why this is his ace in the hole.</i>

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:10.940
<i>It's a difficult technique to handle.</i>

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:31.030
<i>No matter how fast your reactions 
are, it's too late now.</i>

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:36.890
What?

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:42.350
You're right that I can control 
White Nagamushi from a distance.

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:47.370
But its true strength is that 
it follows my opponents.

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:51.780
It never lets its prey escape!

00:21:56.370 --> 00:22:00.090
<i>The sun came up, aiya, and it's 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya</i>

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:04.050
<i>The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through</i>

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:08.140
<i>There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they're fat and look delicious</i>

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:12.060
<i>But I don't want any if you 
don't cook them with red peppers</i>

00:22:12.220 --> 00:22:16.190
<i>But I don't want any if you 
don't cook them with red peppers</i>

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:20.270
<i>Cute, cute girl</i>

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:24.150
<i>She has such a calm face</i>

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:28.070
<i>But with her giant shovel, 
she goes from one hill to the next</i>

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:31.660
<i>And fills them with holes</i>

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:35.910
<i>I don't know where she came from</i>

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:39.750
<i>But if you make her mad, she'll punch you</i>

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:43.880
<i>She's always in a daze, 
but she's terrifying</i>

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:47.680
<i>She'll smack you without 
warning if you're stupid</i>

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:51.800
<i>Even in dark places where 
the moon doesn't shine</i>

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.770
<i>This dignified girl is never scared</i>

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:59.850
<i>She works hard all night burying</i>

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:04.020
<i>She buries others in order to survive</i>

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:08.280
<i>The sun came up, aiya, and it's 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya</i>

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:12.160
<i>The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through</i>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:16.040
<i>There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they're fat and look delicious</i>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:20.120
<i>But I don't want any if you 
don't cook them with red peppers</i>

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:22.880
<i>But I don't want any if you 
don't have red peppers...</i>

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:25.210
<i>I don't, I don't, I don't!</i>

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:28.620
I beat Reigyoku-sama, right?

00:23:26.010 --> 00:23:27.260
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:30.730
Which means the Raten Taishou arc is over?

00:23:30.730 --> 00:23:33.760
Oh, right. The Zensei arc 
starts next episode.

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:35.380
Wait, what's going to happen?

00:23:35.380 --> 00:23:37.960
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita - 
The Outcast</i>, "Exorcism."

00:23:36.270 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>16: Exorcism</b>

00:23:37.960 --> 00:23:39.290
If you don't watch it, I'll bury you.
